# EduExplain AI - Frontend Environment Configuration Example
# When deployed to Vercel, set VITE_API_URL in the Vercel Project Settings > Environment Variables.
# Point this to your deployed backend API (e.g. Render, Railway, Fly.io, or Heroku).
# Note: Do NOT use localhost or 127.0.0.1 in production.

VITE_API_URL=https://your-backend-url.example.com
